{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10221","headline":"白田西忆楚州使君弟 · 李嘉佑","name":"白田西忆楚州使君弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山阳郭里无潮，野水自向新桥。\n鱼网平铺荷叶，鹭鸶闲步稻苗。\n秣陵归人惆怅，楚地连山寂寥。\n却忆士龙宾阁，清琴绿竹萧萧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}